# Frontend Knowledge — White-Label Esports Competitive Platform

You are working in the FRONTEND project.

This project is the user-facing application of a multi-tenant, DNS-based white-label esports ecosystem.

It connects to a Supabase backend.
You do NOT control schema or migrations.
You only consume existing backend resources.

====================================================
1) CORE RESPONSIBILITY
====================================================

The frontend is responsible for:

- UI / UX
- State management
- Supabase client queries (anon key only)
- Calling existing Edge Functions
- Real-time subscriptions
- Responsive layout
- Animations
- Gamification visuals
- Branding per config_id
- Internationalization (EN / FR / ES)

The frontend is NOT allowed to:

- Create or modify database schema
- Generate migrations
- Create SQL files
- Modify RLS
- Deploy Edge Functions
- Use service_role
- Execute Supabase CLI

If a feature requires schema changes:
→ Generate a backend request Markdown file
→ Do NOT implement the schema directly

